.source ""


# direct methods
.method public constructor <init>()V
    .registers 1

    invoke-direct {p0}, Lなぎぱいぢぎ/なぎぱいぢぎ/〺つふすそ/〺つふすそ/ぉひのべい/びぐびあび;-><init>()V

